  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IEA Sub-Saharan African Country Energy Analyses</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the development of country energy transition analyses will provide knowledge on the how the selected countries in Sub-Saharan Africa, Uganda and Mozambique, can secure an energy transition that both enables universal access to energy by 2030 (SDG7) as well as an energy supply aligned with a climate neutral future (SDG13). Household energy access is a focus area, and the report will have policy recommendations for improving access and attracting increased private investment.</narrative>
  </description>
